1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
一个馍，夹了两千年
One flatbread, filled for 2,000 years

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
西安，肉夹馍
Xi'an — the rou jia mo

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
名字是「肉夹于馍」的省略
The name means meat clasped in bread

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,200
腊汁肉：战国叫「寒肉」
Sauced meat — once called han rou

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,400
秦灭韩，做法传进长安
Qin conquered Han, the recipe reached Chang'an

6
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,600
白吉馍：铁圈虎背菊花心
The bun: iron ring, tiger back, chrysanthemum heart

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,800
皮薄松脆，内里软绵
Crisp shell, soft and fluffy inside

8
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,000
1904，樊家把肉与馍合一
1904, the Fan family joined meat and bun

9
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,200
挑夫单手就能吃
Porters could eat it one-handed

10
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,400
一口酥脆，一口流汁
Crunch outside, juices within

11
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,600
肥瘦、纯瘦，你选哪种？
Fatty or lean — which do you order?

12
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,000
四座城，四顿早饭，看饿了吗？
Four cities, four breakfasts — hungry yet?
